.
.  Generate sample output for EV1 HAZ plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
set ipl1na ev1ha2.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Extreme Value Type I (Maximum) Hazard
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Hazard
X1LABEL X
.
SET MINMAX 2
PLOT EV1HAZ(X) FOR X = -4 0.01 4
. PLOT EXP(X) FOR X = -4 0.01 4
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv EV1HA2.PS ev1ha2.ps
.
quit
